I have connected git hub repo to argo cd using token and username, still seeing this issue while trying to add application in argocd : Unable to load data: Request has been terminated Possible causes: the network is offline, Origin is not allowed by Access-Control-Allow-Origin, the page is being unloaded, etc.

1) kubectl get svc argocd-server -n argocd = check server reflects the lb address 
2) kubectl get pods -n argocd = pods running status
3) kubectl describe svc argocd-server -n argocd = endpoints mapped
4) ensure the LB from AWS Console allows port 80 and 443 (https)
5) ensure health checks passing 

run
 kubectl port-forward svc/argocd-server -n argocd 8080:443

and then try to argocd lb address - worked 

